# The Dockerfile copies exactly three paths, so the context is exactly those three. Without
# this, every `make up --build` uploads node_modules (tens of megabytes of devDependencies the
# image never installs) to the daemon and then discards it.
#
# Deny-all plus explicit exceptions, so a new top-level file cannot silently join the context.
# Docker reads the Dockerfile itself outside the context, so excluding it here is harmless.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!src
